  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TWAS Research Grants and Science diplomacy        programme 2012-2016 - TWAS 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TWAS Research Grants and Science diplomacy        programme 2012-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka forskning inom matematik, fysik, kemi och biologi i fattiga l&#xe4;nder, samt &#xf6;ka kunskapen hos nationella regeringar om     f&#xf6;rdelarna med att investera i vetenskap och teknik. TWAS Research    Grants Program ger anslag till forskningsprojekt inom biologi, kemi,  matematik och fysik av antingen enskilda forskare eller               forskningsgrupper.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to strengthen research in mathematics, physics, chemistry and biology in poor countries, and to increase awareness among        governments about the benefits of investing in science and            technology. Twas Research Grants Program provides funding for         research in biology, chemistry, mathematics and physics of either     individual researchers or research groups.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase, within the next 5 years the production and use of high-quality research of relevance to target countries, conducted by individual scientists, groups and consortia. Establishment within 2 years an international programme in science diplomacy within TWAS (in partnership with the US based AAAS).Establishment within 5 years, activities that will enhance links between scientists and government representatives.</narrative>
  </description>
